  "question": {
    "text": "<p>See the following chemical reaction:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>XH</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>YCr</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ZH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>The sum of X, Y and Z is</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "23",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given equation can be balanced using ion-electron method as shown below.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-oxidation Half reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Cr</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp;-Reduction Half reaction</p><p>The overall reaction is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Cr</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>The values&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>23</mn></math></p>",
